tipleColorSemanticToken":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplecolorsemantictoken","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","title":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A semantic token that wraps a combination of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/ColorSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":" values based on the color scheme (light or dark mode)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Figma","type":"text"}]},{"text":" inside one object.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"If a color token has a value that depends on the color scheme, it must be packed in a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}}}